concept:australian-heritage-council-act-2003-sec-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "8 Term of office of members"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-8 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A member is to be appointed on a part-time basis.  (2) A member holds office for the period specified in the instrument of appointment. The period must not exceed 3 years, or 1 year for an appointment of an associate member.  (3) A member cannot be appointed for more than 2 consecutive periods." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A member is to be appointed on a part-time basis.  (2) A member holds office for the period specified in the instrument of appointment. The period must not exceed 3 years, or 1 year for an appointment of an associate member.  (3) A member cannot be appointed for more than 2 consecutive periods."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "bceb8d51f2a45855fb9260597af9be22e2ce333f835bed98b1c2d646f0471848" ;
    cof:pageNumber "10"^^xsd:integer ;
