concept:australian-heritage-council-act-2003-sec-10 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10 Outside employment or other activities that conflict with a"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-10 ;
    values:originalText "member’s duties  A member must not engage in any paid employment, or any other activity, that the Minister is satisfied conflicts or may conflict with the proper performance of the member’s duties." ;
