concept:australian-heritage-council-act-2003-sec-20 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20 Conduct of meetings"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-20 ;
    values:originalText "The Council may, subject to this Part, regulate proceedings at its meetings as it considers appropriate. Note: Section 33B of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901 provides for participation in meetings by telephone etc.   Meetings of the Council  Part 4  Section 20A  Australian Heritage Council Act 2003 Compilation date: 1/7/19 Registered: 1/7/19" ;
    skos:definition "The Council may, subject to this Part, regulate proceedings at its meetings as it considers appropriate. Note: Section 33B of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901 provides for participation in meetings by telephone etc.   Meetings of the Council  Part 4  Section 20A  Australian Heritage Council Act 2003 Compilation date: 1/7/19 Registered: 1/7/19"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f5cce62ce29b15439a156929694aa9c2b61f9e7b3cbc42f345c7b6b448e8c24c" ;
